  "created": "2026-11-02T14:52:38.833Z",
  "description": "Pure C# JPEG XL plugin for PictureSharp. Detects and identifies JPEG XL files (raw codestream and container), decodes still lossy (VarDCT, XYB) and lossless (Modular) images, including recompressed JPEGs, patches, progressive files, photon noise and splines, encodes images lossily (VarDCT with quality, distance and effort 1-9, about as small as cjxl, the default) or losslessly (8-bit or 16-bit Modular, about as small as cjxl -d 0 -e 7), losslessly transcodes sequential and progressive 8-bit JPEG with byte-exact original reconstruction, and reads, writes and edits the ICC profile, EXIF and XMP (also Brotli-compressed).",
  "id": "PictureSharp.Jxl",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-11-02T14:58:16.387Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
