  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.8.15: photon noise and splines are decoded like djxl (Image.Load, Identify, the frame reader and JxlLayers; the same pixels at every thread count), and JxlEncoderOptions.PhotonNoiseIso adds film grain like cjxl --photon_noise_iso to lossy output. Requires PictureSharp 0.9.1. See docs/releases/release-0.8.15.md and docs/design/0.8.15-noise-splines.md.",
